{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "899f71dcf8e2a44fb27097f13d21f712d68906f2115dba3ec96bfd3b275b6fdb", "ja": "†終わり†は始まり", "zh": "†结束†即为开始", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0708585cd14056b937c0b02f472660af9fc9ac02aecfcac83d5ceba8eeb8148f", "ja": "公演の打ち上げでアフタヌーンティーにやっ\nてきた一同。公演が終わっても、ユニット活\n動は始まったばかり。次の仕事に思いを馳せ\nるメンバー達なのだった。", "zh": "一行人享用着下午茶来庆祝公演的成功。\n虽然公演已结束，但这个团体的活动\n才正要开始。\n成员们各自对下一份工作有着不同的想像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2ed42e51ca522881f18378c6a775f8c2ee90d09b40c705ef185dce59236cb668", "ja": "（百合子たちの公演は、ゴシックな世界観が大好評！\nやっぱりみんな、好きなんだな……）", "zh": "（百合子她们的公演因歌德风的世界观而大受好评！\n大家果然喜欢这种风格……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "f1214908352af5abad15763ac5bef50906ab5fdf6dda7922b6fc194f9bb61f3b", "ja": "せっかく……せっかくゴシックな公演の後だし、余韻に\n浸ろうと思ってアフタヌーンティーに誘ったのに……。", "zh": "毕竟是难得的歌德风公演，我希望可以一起享受\n公演结束后的余韵，才邀大家来喝下午茶的，然而……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "0f1a14d9c5554f8ec6868fa1be4287235e5c20fb940e19ceb2556caf59b17683", "ja": "えーっ！？　このケーキ、選び放題なの？　すっげー！\n女子って、ふだんこういうトコくるのか～。", "zh": "什么──！？这些蛋糕可以随便拿？真厉害──！\n原来女生平常会来这种地方啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "ef5a75367ec93bdcc60beb9f1858e5a05f7ce3bcfa9e1d1b4c75652bc0d2a108", "ja": "カラフルにデコレーションされたケーキが\nナイスですね！　それに、どれもデリシャスですよ♪", "zh": "有Colorful Decoration的Cake真是Nice呢！\n而且，不管哪个都很Delicious喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "87594c99fabc36415afa8a699bf9ecae09a03762e4246f7848c87cb85e1c1a52", "ja": "公演も、楽しかったですが。打ち上げで、\nこんなにおいしいケーキが食べられるなんて……役得。", "zh": "虽然公演也很开心，但没想到庆功宴\n能享用这么美味的蛋糕……赚到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "ce26bf5886156fedf4e5da4434d28e6d0993279410ab6008cad0f46eff9cbf67", "ja": "百合子さん……。杏奈の、チーズケーキ……\nひと口、食べる……？　おいしい……よ……？", "zh": "百合子……杏奈的起司蛋糕……\n你要不要吃一口……？很好吃……哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "6fc62429312676c9593cfa9883cd6a85e1eea48ac2d02c31598eaf518c10b175", "ja": "むぅ～…………。", "zh": "唔…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "75f6ba1d4600dec9a4027c721e17bba6e298dff93a24705900f7f71a1d785e5b", "ja": "百合子、どうかしたのか？\nふくれっ面して……。", "zh": "百合子，你怎么了？\n一脸不开心的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "76d6777be18b6bcd16389a0d213ce2059f9dfdfb81a0d4aa7b96199424d678f6", "ja": "だ、だって！　みんな、ケーキの話ばっかり！\nもっと公演の話とか、ゴシックの話とか……！", "zh": "谁、谁叫大家都只顾着吃蛋糕！\n再多聊聊跟公演，或是歌德风有关的话题啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "e5eff3c426cf8c763c0ed10a947f37bf5a4c2da99815a814a26570251333d2a0", "ja": "百合子、いらねーの？\n食べないなら、オレがもらっちゃうぜ。", "zh": "百合子，你不吃啊？\n不吃的话，我就收下啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8e96c84f7bb7b0a0532371bcf739fda6fe464eb4a85856a79a69fb2ef80bc18", "ja": "い、いらなくないです、食べますけど！\nもぐもぐ……あ、おいしい♪　えへへ♪", "zh": "我、我才没有说不吃，我要吃啦！\n嚼嚼嚼……啊，真好吃♪嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "b28b7bceab77d82836a65efde779cb3e9051f24cb1963e518359cc27d7a4cc7d", "ja": "百合子さん……。杏奈、百合子さんと、みんなと……\n打ち上げできて、うれしい……。", "zh": "百合子……杏奈可以跟你，还有大家……\n一起庆功，觉得好开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "5d48898d499973517d19250768294b61a4fa39696f5dbabc0d83d060ded2a975", "ja": "百合子さんは……？\nあんまり、楽しくない……？", "zh": "百合子呢……\n你好像不怎么开心……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "abf332397197c037a2a8889f2b600ee71776dfbe2a0d4e059fb758a4144e7154", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……！　ううん、そんなことないよ！\n私もみんなとアフタヌーンティーできて、うれしい！", "zh": "小杏……！不是的，我没有觉得不开心喔！\n我也很高兴能和大家一起享用下午茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "2755a71e90fa66ac97bf297ab9e19d55894eeecc7a7f6856952bda274245abc6", "ja": "はっ！　……もしかして私、公演も打ち上げも、\n自分の趣味をみんなに押し付けて……！？", "zh": "啊！我是不是除了公演之外……\n在庆功时也把自己的兴趣强加在大家身上了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "030975596c49a00b85cf3458dbd89cf82334e0dd2e416d20ae83a069767d31f2", "ja": "別にいいんじゃない？　ケーキうまいし。\nそれよりさ、今度はみんなで野球しようぜ！", "zh": "这有什么关系？反正蛋糕很好吃。\n不说这个了，下次大家一起打棒球吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "5776ec1e848c2c68454bed78f670488a13af346df46444825530e9fe857c48a2", "ja": "野球ですか。たまには面白そうですね。\nでは、受けて立ちましょう……かっとばせ、瑞希。", "zh": "棒球啊，偶尔打一下好像很有意思。\n那么，我接受挑战……打飞出去，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "50aa258f87e8e8edca147f1de2d88af825ad03edbd552c430fdcabe5b89a5d51", "ja": "杏奈は……野球の、ゲームなら……。", "zh": "杏奈……如果是棒球游戏的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "0a6208f568b780eacbef32440defc1c1c019b9760a2cdc5fda297a70fde8b711", "ja": "それなら、ロコはレフェリーをやりますね。\nスリーカウント、チェンジです！", "zh": "这样的话，ROCO来当Referee。\nThree Count，Change！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "5545e3a03cacb42e8b0b26d28a7e5cd4c30cb5d989a20af79506baacb7bef666", "ja": "野球にレフェリーいないし！\nロコ、ルールわかってるのかよ～？", "zh": "棒球的裁判哪是Referee啊！\nROCO，你真的懂规则吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "2da25f79c800e34114d20a6b55aeda0aeeda242e93719fd38bf17f6c9ddeb0d6", "ja": "アートもベースボールも、フィーリングです！\nどうにかなりますよ、スバル。", "zh": "不管是Art还是Baseball，都是看Feeling！\n总会有办法的，昴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "c5f5c317cf49d0dcc584a8c8a41811eba52389c15268b915b933850fd3e12a1b", "ja": "や、野球……！？　でも私、運動はそこまで……\nみんなの足を、引っ張っちゃったりしないかな？", "zh": "打、打棒球……！？可是我不是那么擅长运动……\n会不会扯大家的后腿啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "fc6b98acf4935497eb351b5a9a49ef4c69c8ca372ca012b3de02cb86c7d210b6", "ja": "大丈夫大丈夫！　百合子、運命ナントカ鬼の時も、\nオレのこと助けてくれたじゃん。", "zh": "别担心别担心！百合子在玩那个什么\n命运捉迷藏的时候，不也救了我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "1dcfc9565fe7594c184aa02305d2439c9531aa2a5ac9a4c030fac81a73a2fe2c", "ja": "なんかオレ、百合子なら\nミラクルプレーができそうな気がするんだよ！", "zh": "我觉得百合子到时候上场，\n一定能有奇迹表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "6f441f824d0aabaa65d2d79bcab149c2e7fee3323f7cc5d6fe799f0a0dfaf604", "ja": "昴さん……わかりました！　私、がんばって……\nは、ハットトリックを決めてみせます！", "zh": "昴……我明白了！我会加油……\n做、做出帽子戏法的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "6585ae5df68e3227583b7d777c32a8f01373438ebe4684d3724769cbdfb6a058", "ja": "惜しい！\n百合子、ハットトリックはサッカーだな。", "zh": "差一点就说对了！\n百合子，帽子戏法是足球才有的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "731b368b13b05b36baba24d2287ce96c54a45d74e4a7d896577147e7c735bce0", "ja": "えええええっ！", "zh": "咦咦咦咦咦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "b0c93dadab8d96f1c8d319767d02f078aa45355ef491332dd0d56724dbb6e51b", "ja": "あはは！　でもオレも、ゴシックな世界観っていうの？\nちょっとわかってきた気がするんだ！", "zh": "啊哈哈！但我好像也越来越懂\n那个叫做歌德风的世界观了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "79ada0e1e5ed63adb50b08f2ec5bcc8f9168a9c294b9e0f3ba62021b3acd1c24", "ja": "えーと、オレの闇の魔球？で、みんなを\nしん……深淵？に突き落としてやるぜ！", "zh": "呃，看我用黑暗魔球？\n将大家轰进深……深渊里！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "2ef0b4f0e25267451da5b5f5f5bc2aa632ddb45feb461de04409f2a8198dd995", "ja": "おー……。\n昴さん……覚醒、した……？", "zh": "哦……\n昴……觉醒了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "145937f560b87c7f859b407cc3be4b42b63ce9b966b110e298f76dbc22183ff2", "ja": "えっと……うん。\n昴、なかなか新しいぞ！　新境地だな！", "zh": "呃……嗯。\n昴，这风格相当新颖喔！是新境界呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "0368bfd5194d4ca53c35f939c5eda955acec2a9e20b525677497fe55d7e77729", "ja": "へへっ、だろ？　オレだって練習すれば、\nゴシックロリータくらい、使いこなせるんだぜ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，对吧？就算是我，只要经过练习，\n区区歌德风萝莉塔也是能掌握的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_07_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "e1c31d6ccf99e8f1b8c7882d33a8cb86f433ca9c5e6ee1fc2e0a1ae0a589637d", "ja": "な、何かちょっと違う気もしますけど……良しと\nします！　みんな、野球もユニットも、がんばろうね！", "zh": "总、总觉得好像不太对……不过算了！\n大家，不管是棒球还是团体，都一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
